    "sub_name": "數據分析的工程應用",
    "sub_ename": "APPLICATIONS OF DATA ANALYSIS IN ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程由製程技術的數據分析展開，介紹數據分析原理與方法，統計學的工程意義，及這些分析方法的使用時機，讓學生了解數據分析方法與運用時機相關知識。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will start with data analysis of process technology, introduce the principles and methods of data analysis, the significance of statistics in engineering, and the timing of using these analysis methods, so that students may understand relevant knowledge of data analysis methods and the timing of applying it.",
